            "text": "Hi, I'm Maya"
          }
        },
        "p1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>The first one was a page for lecture notes that asked me questions back, built in my second year at university. I still use a version of it, and so do a few of my old classmates.</p>"
          }
        },
        "p2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>These days I coordinate projects for a small design studio, and the planning templates come from that job. The weekly reset, the time blocks and the project board are the ones I open every day. The home ones started when I moved into a shared flat and someone had to keep track of the bills.</p>"
          }
        },
        "p3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>If a template does not work the way you expected, email me at <a href=\"mailto:hello@octavo.example\">hello@octavo.example</a> and I will help you sort it out.</p><p><strong>Maya</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "p0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>I make Notion templates for studying, planning the week and running a home. Each one started as a page I built for myself and kept using.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
